  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_01",
      "hash64": "826FC03D93904B40",
      "text": "Voici l’incroyable parc sous-marin, dont\\nla renommée mondiale ne fait que grandir...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_02",
      "hash64": "826FC33D93905059",
      "text": "Le [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Terra-Dôme[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] de l’Institut Myrtille ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "826FC23D93904EA6",
      "text": "Le parc est muni de projecteurs. Ils projettent\\nsur les murs et le plafond des paysages similaires\\r\\nà la surface, mais nous sommes bien sous la mer ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 151,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "826FC53D939053BF",
      "text": "Grâce à cette technologie, nous avons pu recréer\\ndes biotopes propices au bien-être des Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_01",
      "hash64": "A14518385BCF1AFB",
      "text": "Et c’est moi qui ai dessiné les plans !\\nJ’ai dépensé sans compter ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "826FC43D9390520C",
      "text": "Le Terra-Dôme est divisé en quatre zones.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_06",
      "hash64": "826FC73D93905725",
      "text": "Tout d’abord, il y a la Zone Savane, au climat\\nchaud et sec.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_07",
      "hash64": "826FC63D93905572",
      "text": "Ensuite, à droite, tu trouveras la Zone Côtière\\net son climat tropical.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "826FC93D93905A8B",
      "text": "À gauche se trouvent la Zone Canyon\\net ses reliefs rocheux.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "826FC83D939058D8",
      "text": "Et enfin, tout au fond du dôme se trouve\\nla Zone Polaire, avec son paysage arctique.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "826C5B3D938D69CA",
      "text": "La température et le niveau d’humidité de toutes\\nces zones sont régulés avec le plus grand soin.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_11",
      "hash64": "826C5C3D938D6B7D",
      "text": "Et chaque climat permet d’abriter des Pokémon\\ncomplètement différents ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_02",
      "hash64": "A14519385BCF1CAE",
      "text": "Aucun détail n’a été laissé au hasard ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_12",
      "hash64": "826C593D938D6664",
      "text": "Alors, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], quelle zone t’intrigue\\nle plus ?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_select_01",
      "hash64": "52386A030425028D",
      "text": "La Zone Savane.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_select_02",
      "hash64": "523867030424FD74",
      "text": "La Zone Côtière.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_select_03",
      "hash64": "523868030424FF27",
      "text": "La Zone Canyon.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_select_04",
      "hash64": "523865030424FA0E",
      "text": "La Zone Polaire.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_13",
      "hash64": "826C5A3D938D6817",
      "text": "C’est vrai que c’est l’environnement qui nous\\nest le plus familier.\\c\\nEt sa topologie permet d’observer facilement\\nles Pokémon dans leur habitat naturel.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_14",
      "hash64": "826C573D938D62FE",
      "text": "Oh ! C’est aussi ma zone préférée ! L’ambiance\\ntropicale y est particulièrement relaxante ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_15",
      "hash64": "826C583D938D64B1",
      "text": "Tu aimes donc les reliefs escarpés ?\\nDans ce cas, tu vas être servi[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e !\\c\\nSache que dans cette zone, on peut trouver\\nun mystérieux minerai appelé électrolithe ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 165,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_16",
      "hash64": "826C553D938D5F98",
      "text": "Oh, tu aimes le froid ? Moi, je suis un peu trop\\nfrileuse, mais je dois avouer que les Pokémon\\r\\nde type Glace qui y vivent sont adorables ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_17",
      "hash64": "826C563D938D614B",
      "text": "Si tu as besoin de soigner ton équipe, n’hésite\\npas à utiliser les [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]machines de soin automatiques[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].\\c\\nIl y en a un peu partout dans le Terra-Dôme,\\net tout le monde peut s’en servir librement ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 199,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_18",
      "hash64": "826C533D938D5C32",
      "text": "Bien. Monsieur Cyano, c’est à vous.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_19",
      "hash64": "826C543D938D5DE5",
      "text": "Pouvez-vous expliquer comment les Pokémon\\nsauvages de l’Institut Myrtille parviennent\\r\\nà se téracristalliser et pourquoi des cristaux\\r\\nse forment dans le Terra-Dôme ?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 170,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_03",
      "hash64": "A1451A385BCF1E61",
      "text": "Allons ! Tu connais très bien ce processus !\\nOh, j’ai compris ! C’est à mon tour d’expliquer ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_04",
      "hash64": "A1451B385BCF2014",
      "text": "Écoute, c’est très simple...\\nLève les yeux vers le ciel ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_05",
      "hash64": "A1451C385BCF21C7",
      "text": "Ce que tu vois s’appelle le [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Terra-Noyau[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].\\nIl veille sur le Terra-Dôme, en quelque sorte.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_06",
      "hash64": "A1451D385BCF237A",
      "text": "À l’intérieur se trouve un liquide dans lequel\\nnous avons incorporé une substance spéciale\\r\\nqui provient de Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_headbb_07",
      "hash64": "A1451E385BCF252D",
      "text": "Ce liquide émet un rayonnement d’énergie\\nTéracristal qui nous permet d’utiliser\\r\\nla Téracristallisation sous le dôme ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_20",
      "hash64": "8269553D938B29C1",
      "text": "Précisément ! N’est-ce pas merveilleux ?![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0060_fairybb_21",
      "hash64": "8269543D938B280E",
      "text": "Toutefois, une question me taraude... Quelle est\\nla nature exacte de cette « substance » ?\\c\\nCette information n’a jamais été rendue\\npublique, n’est-ce pas ?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 158,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
